  "mainIdea": {
    "text": "Ms. Lin and ZiXuan joined Jett and Sage at a night harbor to carry a radianite safety box to the control desk. Mirror Guard copied Jett's dash, stole the box, and took it under a crane. When it also copied Sage's protection, ZiXuan wrote down each recent move. His notes showed that the Guard copied only the latest clear ability. The team then slowed down and made a plan. Jett used a fake dash to pull the Guard away, while Sage saved her real wall. Ms. Lin and ZiXuan reached the desk, stopped the copy program, recovered the box, and made the crane safe again."
  }
